= Biography

== Professional Profile

*Jing Zhang* is currently an Associate Professor at Xi'an University of Science and Technology.

She received her Ph.D. degree in Computer Application Technology from Northwest University.

Her research focuses on IoT sensing and intelligent systems, with particular interests in mobile crowdsensing, artificial intelligence, intelligent sensing, and their applications to coal-mine safety and industrial IoT.

== Research Interests

- Internet of Things and Intelligent Systems
- Mobile Crowdsensing
- Artificial Intelligence
- Intelligent Sensing
- Industrial IoT
- Coal-Mine Safety Monitoring

