== Awards

- *2024* — Second Prize of the China Coal Industry Science and Technology Award, for the project "Coal-Mine Major Disaster Risk Monitoring, Early Warning and Collaborative Safety Production Management System."

- *2023* — Third Prize of the Science and Technology Award of Shaanxi Higher Education Institutions, for the project "Research on Data-Driven Automatic Image Rendering Based on Deep Neural Networks."

